 *
 * This slot is Raindrop's "Loved by developers" wall. Maple has no
 * testimonials, so rather than fake quotes it carries the information a
 * developer actually wants here: which runtimes are covered. Logos are
 * runtimes, not customers — the customer logos live in the hero foot.
 *
 * Marks are simple-icons paths (MIT), rendered monochrome so the row reads as
 * one hairline object rather than a row of brand colours.
 */
